# The GUI acceptance probes that `scripts/listening-dev.sh acceptance` runs, in order.
# Format: NAME EVIDENCE-PROBE ACCEPTANCE-PROBE  (- when there is no evidence probe).
# The evidence probe writes the screenshots its acceptance probe then checks.
# What a run must produce is expected/NAME.checks, judged by acceptance_verdict.py.
next listening-next-ui listening-next-acceptance
o2 listening-next-rooms listening-o2-acceptance
o3 listening-listen-ui listening-o3-acceptance
o4 - listening-o4-acceptance
o5 listening-session-ui listening-o5-acceptance
o6 - listening-o6-acceptance
o10h - listening-o10h-acceptance
o10c - listening-o10c-acceptance
o10y - listening-o10y-acceptance
o10l - listening-o10l-acceptance
o10p - listening-o10p-acceptance
o11s - listening-o11s-acceptance
